## Interim behavior

- **Allowed** when it gets the feature to users faster **or** gives the team **earlier observable-test feedback**.
- **Remove** interim behavior when a **later slice** replaces it with the intended design.

## Guardrails

- NEVER encode GSD phase numbers in product code/tests/docs
- NEVER leave completed plans as a permanent `.planning/` diary
- NEVER skip commit+push between slices in this repo when running **execute-plan**
- NEVER deliberately end a slice (or ship a commit) with CI-breaking failing tests
- NEVER commit at the red step of TDD; wait until at least one full cycle is green

